            <div xml:id="d406-a1-a25">

                <pb facs="0661" n="591" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg591"/>

                <p>[Enclosure No. 9.]</p>
                <p>FOREIGN RELATIONS, DEPARTMENT OP GOVERNMENT—SECTION FIRST.</p>
                <p>The President of the republic has decided that you will please direct that at
                    once a diligence extraordinary be prepared to go as speedily as possible from
                    this city to Queretaro; said diligence to be placed under the control of Baron
                    A. V. Magnus, with the persons he may choose to accompany him.</p>
                <p>This I communicate to you to the end that said diligence extraordinary may be
                    ready at the hour Baron de Magnus may appoint for this afternoon, or this day’s
                    night.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">Independence and liberty ! <placeName>San Luis
                            Potosi</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-06-16">June
                            16, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>LERDO DE TEJADA.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>The <hi rendition="#small-caps">Administrador de Diligencias</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">of this city.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
